<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f3f9fd">
  <meta name="description" content="Estimate how much a bond portfolio could lose if interest rates rise.">
  <title>Bond Rate Risk Calculator</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='14' fill='%23123b5d'/%3E%3Cpath d='M17 18h30v28H17z' fill='%23fff'/%3E%3Cpath d='M23 26h18M23 33h18M23 40h11' stroke='%23123b5d' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
  <style>
:root {
  color-scheme: light;
  --navy: #1c4f7e;
  --navy-deep: #123b63;
  --blue: #2d7fbd;
  --blue-bright: #6ab6e8;
  --blue-soft: #eaf6ff;
  --blue-pale: #f7fbff;
  --ink: #18334a;
  --muted: #526b7c;
  --line: #c9deec;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --background: #f3f9fd;
  --loss: #9d2525;
  --loss-soft: #fff1f0;
  --warning: #7a341e;
  --focus: #f3a712;
  font-family: "Aptos", "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
  font-size: 18px;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html { scroll-behavior: auto; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 8% 4%, rgba(106, 182, 232, 0.16), transparent 25rem),
    radial-gradient(circle at 96% 34%, rgba(45, 127, 189, 0.08), transparent 29rem),
    var(--background);
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.55;
}

button, input, select { font: inherit; }

button, input, select, label { touch-action: manipulation; }

.skip-link {
  position: fixed;
  z-index: 100;
  top: 0.5rem;
  left: 0.5rem;
  transform: translateY(-180%);
  background: white;
  color: var(--navy-deep);
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
  border: 3px solid var(--focus);
  border-radius: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }

.site-header {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
  color: var(--navy-deep);
  border-bottom: 1px solid #cce2f0;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(18, 59, 99, 0.06);
}

.site-header::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  right: -5rem;
  bottom: -8rem;
  width: 22rem;
  height: 22rem;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(106, 182, 232, 0.12);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.header-inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 2rem));
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.25rem;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 2rem 0 2.1rem;
}

.brand-mark {
  flex: 0 0 4rem;
  width: 4rem;
  height: 4rem;
  border: 2px solid #b7d9ed;
  border-radius: 1.25rem;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #e7f5fe);
  box-shadow: 0 7px 18px rgba(30, 97, 145, 0.12);
}

.brand-mark svg { width: 2.2rem; height: 2.2rem; }
.brand-mark svg path:first-child { fill: var(--navy); stroke: none; }
.brand-mark svg path:last-child { fill: none; stroke: white; stroke-width: 2.4; stroke-linecap: round; }

h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }

h1, h2, h3, .eyebrow, .step-kicker, label, button, legend {
  font-family: ui-rounded, "Trebuchet MS", "Aptos Display", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
}

h1 {
  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.65rem);
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -0.035em;
}

.eyebrow, .step-kicker {
  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.eyebrow { color: var(--blue); }
.header-copy { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.08rem; }

.page-shell {
  width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 2rem));
  margin: 2.25rem auto 3rem;
  display: grid;
  gap: 1.5rem;
}

.step {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 1.35rem;
  padding: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 34px rgba(26, 79, 120, 0.08);
}

.step-heading {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem;
  align-items: flex-start;
  padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #e2eff7;
}

.step-number {
  flex: 0 0 2.75rem;
  width: 2.75rem;
  height: 2.75rem;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--blue), var(--navy));
  color: white;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 12px rgba(28, 79, 126, 0.18);
}

.step-kicker { color: var(--blue); }

h2 { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; color: var(--navy-deep); font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.2; }
h3 { color: var(--navy-deep); }
.step-heading p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--muted); }

.bond-list { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }

.bond-card {
  border: 2px solid #d7e8f2;
  border-radius: 1rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #ffffff;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(38, 103, 151, 0.05);
}

.bond-card-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
  padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
  background: linear-gradient(100deg, #f2faff, var(--blue-soft));
  border-bottom: 1px solid #cfe4f1;
}

.bond-card-header h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; }

.remove-bond {
  min-height: 2.75rem;
  border: 2px solid #a84d4d;
  border-radius: 0.75rem;
  background: white;
  color: var(--loss);
  padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.remove-bond:hover { background: var(--loss-soft); }

.field-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 1.25rem;
  padding: 1.2rem;
}

.field-wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.field label { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; font-weight: 750; color: var(--ink); }

.field input,
.field select {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 3.25rem;
  border: 2px solid #829bab;
  border-radius: 0.75rem;
  background: white;
  color: var(--ink);
  padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
}

.field select { cursor: pointer; }
.field input[readonly] { background: #eef3f6; color: #2f4553; }
.optional-label { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; }

.input-prefix, .input-suffix {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  border: 2px solid #829bab;
  border-radius: 0.75rem;
  background: white;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.input-prefix:focus-within, .input-suffix:focus-within { outline: 4px solid rgba(243, 167, 18, .45); border-color: var(--navy-deep); }
.input-prefix span, .input-suffix span { flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 0 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); }
.input-prefix input, .input-suffix input { min-width: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 0; }
.input-prefix input:focus, .input-suffix input:focus { outline: none; }

input:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible, .rate-option:has(input:focus-visible) {
  outline: 4px solid rgba(243, 167, 18, .55);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

.field.invalid input, .field.invalid select, .field.invalid .input-prefix, .field.invalid .input-suffix { border-color: var(--loss); }
.field.invalid input { background: #fffafa; }

.help-text { min-height: 2.7em; margin: 0.35rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.4; }
.field-error { min-height: 1.45em; margin: 0.2rem 0 0; color: var(--loss); font-weight: 750; }

.button {
  min-height: 3.25rem;
  border-radius: 0.85rem;
  padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.button-secondary { margin-top: 1.25rem; border: 2px solid var(--navy); background: white; color: var(--navy); }
.button-secondary:hover { background: var(--blue-soft); border-color: var(--blue); }

.direction-options,
.rate-options {
  display: grid;
  gap: 0.85rem;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  border: 0;
}

.direction-options { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
.rate-options { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }

.group-legend {
  float: left;
  width: 100%;
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  color: var(--navy-deep);
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 800;
}

.group-legend + * { clear: left; }

.rate-option { position: relative; cursor: pointer; }
.rate-option input { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; opacity: 0; }

.rate-option-content {
  min-height: 7.25rem;
  display: grid;
  place-content: center;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  padding: 1rem;
  border: 2px solid #9ab3c3;
  border-radius: 1rem;
  background: white;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(28, 79, 126, 0.04);
}

.rate-option:hover .rate-option-content { background: var(--blue-soft); border-color: var(--blue); }
.rate-option input:checked + .rate-option-content { border-color: var(--navy); background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f6fbff, var(--blue-soft)); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--navy), 0 7px 18px rgba(28, 79, 126, 0.1); }
.rate-option input:checked + .rate-option-content::before { content: "Selected"; color: var(--navy); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; }
.rate-main { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy-deep); }
.rate-sub { color: var(--muted); }
.direction-options .rate-option-content { min-height: 6.4rem; }

.status-message { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--warning); }
.status-message:empty { display: none; }

.summary-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 0.9rem;
}

.summary-card {
  min-height: 8.5rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 1.15rem;
  border: 2px solid #c9deeb;
  border-radius: 1rem;
  background: var(--blue-pale);
  box-shadow: 0 5px 16px rgba(28, 79, 126, 0.05);
}

.summary-card p { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 750; }
.summary-card strong { font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem); line-height: 1.15; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.loss-card { background: var(--loss-soft); border-color: #d9a9a7; }
.loss-card strong { color: var(--loss); }
.gain-card { background: var(--blue-soft); border-color: #9fc6da; }
.gain-card strong { color: var(--navy-deep); }
.after-card { background: var(--blue-soft); border-color: #a5c7d9; }

.results-table-wrap { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: white; }
caption { padding: 0 0 0.65rem; text-align: left; color: var(--navy-deep); font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; }
th, td { padding: 0.9rem 0.7rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: right; vertical-align: top; }
th { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--navy-deep), var(--navy)); color: white; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.35; }
th:first-child, td:first-child { text-align: left; }
td { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.loss-text { color: var(--loss); font-weight: 800; }
.gain-text { color: var(--navy-deep); font-weight: 800; }
.bond-name-cell strong { display: block; color: var(--ink); }
.structure-tag { display: block; margin-top: 0.2rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; }
.option-notice { border-left-color: var(--navy); }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
.empty-row td { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); }

.notice {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.85rem;
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
  padding: 1rem;
  border: 1px solid #c9e2f1;
  border-left: 5px solid var(--blue);
  border-radius: 1rem;
  background: linear-gradient(110deg, var(--blue-soft), #f8fcff);
}

.notice svg { flex: 0 0 1.6rem; width: 1.6rem; height: 1.6rem; fill: none; stroke: var(--navy); stroke-width: 2; }
.notice h3 { margin-bottom: 0.2rem; font-size: 1rem; }
.notice p { margin: 0; color: #344c5d; }

footer { padding: 1.5rem 1rem 2.5rem; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); }
footer p { margin: 0; }

.sr-only {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  padding: 0;
  margin: -1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
  white-space: nowrap;
  border: 0;
}

@media (max-width: 760px) {
  :root { font-size: 17px; }
  .header-inner { align-items: flex-start; }
  .brand-mark { flex-basis: 3.25rem; width: 3.25rem; height: 3.25rem; }
  .field-grid, .direction-options, .rate-options, .summary-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .field-wide { grid-column: auto; }
  .help-text { min-height: 0; }
  .rate-option-content { min-height: 6.2rem; }

  thead { display: none; }
  table, tbody, tr, td { display: block; width: 100%; }
  tbody { display: grid; gap: 0.85rem; }
  tr { border: 2px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.9rem; padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; background: white; }
  td { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 0.55rem 0; text-align: right; }
  td::before { content: attr(data-label); flex: 0 0 48%; text-align: left; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }
  td:first-child { text-align: right; font-weight: 800; }
  .bond-name-cell { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 48% minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 1rem; text-align: right; }
  .bond-name-cell::before { grid-row: 1 / span 2; }
  .bond-name-cell strong, .bond-name-cell .structure-tag { grid-column: 2; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .empty-row td { display: block; text-align: center; }
  .empty-row td::before { content: none; }
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .header-inner, .page-shell { width: min(100% - 1rem, 1120px); }
  .header-inner { padding: 1.2rem 0; }
  .brand-mark { display: none; }
  .page-shell { margin-top: 0.75rem; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .step { padding: 0.9rem; }
  .step-heading { gap: 0.7rem; }
  .step-number { flex-basis: 2.4rem; width: 2.4rem; height: 2.4rem; }
  .field-grid { padding: 0.9rem; }
  .bond-card-header { align-items: flex-start; }
  .remove-bond { min-height: 2.6rem; }
  .notice { align-items: flex-start; }
}

@media (forced-colors: active) {
  .rate-option input:checked + .rate-option-content { outline: 3px solid ButtonText; }
}

</style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#calculator">Skip to calculator</a>

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" role="img"><path d="M10 8h20v24H10z"/><path d="M15 15h10M15 21h10M15 27h6"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">A plain-language planning tool</p>
        <h1>Bond Rate Risk Calculator</h1>
        <p class="header-copy">See an estimate of how your bond portfolio could change when interest rates rise or fall.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="calculator" class="page-shell">
    <section class="step" aria-labelledby="step-1-title">
      <div class="step-heading">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <div>
          <p class="step-kicker">Step 1</p>
          <h2 id="step-1-title">Enter your bonds</h2>
          <p>Add the details shown on your bond statement. We start with two examples you can change.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="bond-list" class="bond-list" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <button id="add-bond" class="button button-secondary" type="button">
        <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span> Add another bond
      </button>
    </section>

    <section class="step" aria-labelledby="step-2-title">
      <div class="step-heading">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <div>
          <p class="step-kicker">Step 2</p>
          <h2 id="step-2-title">Choose a rate change</h2>
          <p><strong>Rate change:</strong> A hypothetical rise or fall in market interest rates.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <fieldset class="direction-options">
        <legend class="group-legend">First, choose a direction</legend>
        <label class="rate-option">
          <input type="radio" name="rate-direction" value="1" checked>
          <span class="rate-option-content">
            <span class="rate-main">Rates rise</span>
            <span class="rate-sub">Bond prices may fall</span>
          </span>
        </label>
        <label class="rate-option">
          <input type="radio" name="rate-direction" value="-1">
          <span class="rate-option-content">
            <span class="rate-main">Rates fall</span>
            <span class="rate-sub">Bond prices may rise</span>
          </span>
        </label>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="rate-options">
        <legend class="group-legend">Then, choose the size</legend>
        <label class="rate-option">
          <input type="radio" name="rate-shock" value="0.0025">
          <span class="rate-option-content">
            <span class="rate-main">0.25%</span>
            <span class="rate-sub">25 basis points</span>
          </span>
        </label>
        <label class="rate-option">
          <input type="radio" name="rate-shock" value="0.005">
          <span class="rate-option-content">
            <span class="rate-main">0.50%</span>
            <span class="rate-sub">50 basis points</span>
          </span>
        </label>
        <label class="rate-option">
          <input type="radio" name="rate-shock" value="0.01" checked>
          <span class="rate-option-content">
            <span class="rate-main">1.00%</span>
            <span class="rate-sub">100 basis points</span>
          </span>
        </label>
        <label class="rate-option">
          <input type="radio" name="rate-shock" value="0.02">
          <span class="rate-option-content">
            <span class="rate-main">2.00%</span>
            <span class="rate-sub">200 basis points</span>
          </span>
        </label>
      </fieldset>
    </section>

    <section class="step results-step" aria-labelledby="step-3-title">
      <div class="step-heading">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <div>
          <p class="step-kicker">Step 3</p>
          <h2 id="step-3-title">View the estimated loss</h2>
          <p><strong id="result-help-label">Estimated loss:</strong> <span id="result-help-text">The approximate decline in market value if rates rise.</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="calculation-status" class="status-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

      <div class="summary-grid" aria-label="Portfolio estimate">
        <article class="summary-card">
          <p>Current portfolio value</p>
          <strong id="total-current">$0.00</strong>
        </article>
        <article class="summary-card change-card loss-card">
          <p id="dollar-change-label">Estimated dollar loss</p>
          <strong id="total-loss">Loss −$0.00</strong>
        </article>
        <article class="summary-card change-card loss-card">
          <p id="percent-change-label">Estimated percentage loss</p>
          <strong id="total-loss-percent">Loss −0.00%</strong>
        </article>
        <article class="summary-card after-card">
          <p id="after-change-label">Estimated value after rate increase</p>
          <strong id="total-after">$0.00</strong>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="results-table-wrap">
        <table>
          <caption id="result-table-caption">Estimated loss for each valid bond</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Bond name</th>
              <th scope="col">Current value</th>
              <th id="bond-dollar-change-label" scope="col">Estimated dollar loss</th>
              <th id="bond-percent-change-label" scope="col">Estimated percentage loss</th>
              <th id="bond-after-change-label" scope="col">Value after rate increase</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="results-body"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <aside id="option-notice" class="notice option-notice" aria-labelledby="option-notice-title" hidden>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 10v6M12 7h.01"/></svg>
        <div>
          <h3 id="option-notice-title">Callable and putable bond estimate</h3>
          <p>This estimate uses the bond’s final maturity date. A callable bond may have less price upside when rates fall, while a putable bond may have less downside when rates rise. Fully valuing these options requires the option schedule and market-volatility assumptions.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <aside class="notice" aria-labelledby="notice-title">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 10v6M12 7h.01"/></svg>
        <div>
          <h3 id="notice-title">Important notice</h3>
          <p>This calculator provides an estimate based on duration and, when available, convexity. Actual bond prices may also be affected by credit risk, liquidity, embedded options, taxes, and changes in the shape of the yield curve. This is an educational tool, not investment advice.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Calculations assume semiannual coupon payments. Results update as you make changes.</p>
  </footer>

  <template id="bond-template">
    <article class="bond-card">
      <div class="bond-card-header">
        <h3>Bond <span class="bond-position"></span></h3>
        <button class="remove-bond" type="button">Remove bond</button>
      </div>
      <div class="field-grid">
        <div class="field field-wide">
          <label>Bond name</label>
          <input class="bond-name" type="text" autocomplete="off" maxlength="80">
          <p class="help-text">A name you will recognize on your statement.</p>
          <p class="field-error" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>
